NV_PK(28,{"at the corner of dacheng hall's red platform a stone head of a hornless dragon sticks out when it rains water pours out of its mouth it is said only very important buildings like palaces and confucius temples use these heads a small stone lion sits on the post above":"","this is wenchang pavilion a tower with three floors the god of literature sits on the second floor and kuixing the god of exams sits on the top many small potted trees grow in the garden in front":"","here is the front of dacheng hall standing on its red platform in the middle of the steps is the carved imperial path and long side halls stand on both sides":"","look up under the roof red wooden beams hold up the roof layer by layer where beams meet the columns carved wooden pieces hide little animals can you find them":""});